<title>GERMANY: TENNIS-FILDERSTADT WOMEN'S FINAL RESULT.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-FILDERSTADT WOMEN'S FINAL RESULT.</headline>
<dateline>FILDERSTADT, Germany 1996-10-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result in the final at the $450,000 Filderstadt women's tennis tournament on Sunday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>8-Martina Hingis (Switzerland) beat 5-Anke Huber (Germany) 6-2 3-6 6-3</p>
</text>
